      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOONAMAH BARBIE (8) is a first starter from the Dale Baker kennel by Sunset Spitfire out of Myrtle Monelli. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Lot to like about her profile and expected to run well. INFRARED POWER (1) missed the frame last time when sixth (18.68) at this track but prior to that had three placings in a row. Solid record here at the distance winning seven races. One of the better chances. LITTLE RILEY (2) is rarely out of the finish, recording 12 places from 25 starts. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (18.34) at this track. Leading player again. SON OF MINYA (7) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
